              <code code="42229-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="SPL UNCLASSIFIED SECTION"/>
              <title>2.2 Dose in Patients with Renal Impairment</title>
              <text>
                <paragraph>Assess eGFR before starting EXAMPLINE and at least <content styleCode="bold">every 12 months</content> thereafter.</paragraph>
                <list listType="unordered"><item>eGFR 30 to 44 mL/min/1.73 m<sup>2</sup>: half dose.</item><item>eGFR below 30 mL/min/1.73 m<sup>2</sup>: do not use.</item></list>
                <table><thead><tr><th>eGFR</th><th>Dose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>&#8805;45</td><td>10 mg</td></tr><tr><td>30&#8211;44</td><td>5 mg</td></tr></tbody></table>
              </text>
